{"path":"fees.html","content":"<!doctype html>
<html lang="en">
<head>
  <meta charset="utf-8">
  <meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width,initial-scale=1">
  <title>Investment & Membership — {{BUSINESS_NAME}}</title>
  <meta name="description" content="Membership-based psychotherapy offerings and investment overview for ongoing, focused care.">
  <style>
    :root{
      --bg:#fbfcfd;--ink:#0b2545;--muted:#5b6b7a;--accent:#6aa6c9;--card:#ffffff;--glass:rgba(255,255,255,0.6);
      --maxw:980px;
    }
    html,body{height:100%;}
    body{margin:0;font-family:system-ui,-apple-system,Segoe UI,Roboto,"Helvetica Neue",Arial;color:var(--ink);background:linear-gradient(180deg,#f7fbfd 0%,#fbfcfe 60%);-webkit-font-smoothing:antialiased;}
    header{position:relative;padding:28px 20px;max-width:var(--maxw);margin:0 auto;display:flex;align-items:center;justify-content:space-between}
    .brand{display:flex;gap:12px;align-items:center}
    .logo{width:54px;height:54px;border-radius:10px;background:linear-gradient(135deg,var(--accent),#9bd3e8);display:grid;place-items:center;color:#042a42;font-weight:700}
    nav a{color:var(--ink);text-decoration:none;margin-left:18px;font-size:15px}
    nav a.small{font-size:14px;color:var(--muted)}
    .hero{max-width:var(--maxw);margin:12px auto 40px;position:relative;overflow:visible;padding:48px 20px}
    .hero-inner{display:grid;grid-template-columns:1fr 360px;gap:28px;align-items:center}
    .split{background:linear-gradient(135deg,rgba(106,166,201,0.12),rgba(154,211,232,0.06));padding:36px;border-radius:14px;position:relative;overflow:hidden}
    .split:before{content:"";position:absolute;left:-20%;top:-30%;height:220%;width:140%;background-image:url('assets/img/pattern.svg');opacity:0.08;transform:rotate(-12deg)}
    h1{margin:0 0 8px;font-size:24px}
    p.lead{margin:0;color:var(--muted);line-height:1.5}
    .panel{background:var(--card);padding:22px;border-radius:12px;box-shadow:0 6px 18px rgba(11,37,69,0.06)}

    .tiers{display:flex;flex-direction:column;gap:16px}
    .tier{display:flex;justify-content:space-between;align-items:center;padding:14px;border-radius:10px;border:1px solid rgba(11,37,69,0.06)}
    .tier .meta{display:flex;flex-direction:column}
    .tier h3{margin:0;font-size:16px}
    .price{font-weight:700;color:var(--ink)}
    .note{font-size:13px;color:var(--muted)}
    .cta{display:inline-block;background:var(--accent);color:white;padding:10px 14px;border-radius:8px;text-decoration:none}

    .fineprint{font-size:13px;color:var(--muted);margin-top:10px}

    .reveal{opacity:0;transform:translateY(12px);transition:opacity .6s ease,transform .6s ease}
    .reveal.visible{opacity:1;transform:none}

    footer{max-width:var(--maxw);margin:40px auto;padding:18px 20px;color:var(--muted);font-size:13px}

    /* modal styles */
    .modal-backdrop{position:fixed;inset:0;background:rgba(6,20,34,0.45);display:none;align-items:center;justify-content:center;padding:20px;z-index:60}
    .modal{background:var(--card);width:100%;max-width:720px;border-radius:12px;padding:20px;box-shadow:0 18px 50px rgba(11,37,69,0.25)}
    .modal h2{margin:0 0 8px}
    .modal .controls{display:flex;gap:8px;flex-wrap:wrap;margin-bottom:12px}
    .btn{padding:8px 12px;border-radius:8px;border:1px solid rgba(11,37,69,0.06);background:white;cursor:pointer}
    .btn.primary{background:var(--accent);color:white;border:0}
    .exercise-area{height:220px;border-radius:10px;background:linear-gradient(180deg,#fbffff,#f6fbfd);display:flex;align-items:center;justify-content:center;font-size:18px;color:var(--ink)}
    .hidden{display:none}

    @media (max-width:880px){.hero-inner{grid-template-columns:1fr}nav a{display:none}}
    @media (prefers-reduced-motion:reduce){.reveal{transition:none}}
  </style>
</head>
<body>
  <header>
    <div class="brand">
      <div class="logo">TP</div>
      <div>
        <div style="font-weight:700">{{BUSINESS_NAME}}</div>
        <div style="font-size:13px;color:var(--muted)">{{CITY}}, {{STATE}} • Therapy by membership</div>
      </div>
    </div>
    <nav aria-label="Main navigation">
      <a href="index.html">Home</a>
      <a href="about.html">About</a>
      <a href="specialties.html">Focus Areas</a>
      <a href="approach.html">How I Work</a>
      <a href="fees.html" class="small">Investment</a>
      <a href="faq.html" class="small">FAQs</a>
      <a href="book.html" class="small">Schedule</a>
    </nav>
  </header>

  <main class="hero">
    <div class="hero-inner">
      <section class="split">
        <h1>Membership options for ongoing therapeutic care</h1>
        <p class="lead">A membership frames care as an ongoing resource — regular sessions, continuity, and a predictable way to work through challenges over time. Below are options to match different rhythms of work together.</p>
        <div style="height:18px"></div>
        <div class="panel reveal" data-delay="0">
          <div style="display:flex;justify-content:space-between;align-items:center;gap:12px">
            <div>
              <div style="font-size:13px;color:var(--muted);">Quick access</div>
              <div style="font-weight:700">Initial orientation & planning</div>
            </div>
            <a class="cta" href="book.html">{{PRIMARY_CTA_LABEL}}</a>
          </div>
        </div>
      </section>

      <aside class="panel" aria-labelledby="investment">
        <div id="investment" style="font-size:13px;color:var(--muted);margin-bottom:8px">Choose a membership</div>
        <div class="tiers">
          <div class="tier reveal" data-delay="80">
            <div class="meta">
              <h3>Foundations Membership</h3>
              <div class="note">Weekly 45-min session cadence; private messaging within agreed boundaries</div>
            </div>
            <div style="text-align:right">
              <div class="price">$280 / week*</div>
              <div class="note">Billed monthly</div>
            </div>
          </div>

          <div class="tier reveal" data-delay="160">
            <div class="meta">
              <h3>Steady Support</h3>
              <div class="note">Biweekly 50-min sessions; focused planning and tracking between sessions</div>
            </div>
            <div style="text-align:right">
              <div class="price">$520 / month*</div>
              <div class="note">Most common for ongoing work</div>
            </div>
          </div>

          <div class="tier reveal" data-delay="240">
            <div class="meta">
              <h3>Focused Path</h3>
              <div class="note">Shorter, time-limited plan (6–12 sessions) with goal-focused work</div>
            </div>
            <div style="text-align:right">
              <div class="price">$3200 – program rate*</div>
              <div class="note">Single upfront payment or split billing</div>
            </div>
          </div>
        </div>

        <div class="fineprint">*Rates reflect membership investments and administrative services. Sliding-fee options considered; reach out for a confidential conversation about fit. Not a substitute for emergency services.</div>
        <div style="margin-top:12px"><a class="cta" href="book.html">Request a membership conversation</a></div>
      </aside>
    </div>

    <div style="max-width:var(--maxw);margin:22px auto 0;padding:0 20px">
      <div class="panel reveal" data-delay="320">
        <h3 style="margin-top:0">How membership works</h3>
        <p class="note">A membership sets expectations: session frequency, billing cadence, and how we handle messages between sessions. Memberships include scheduling priority and administrative coordination so sessions can focus on clinical work.</p>
        <ul style="color:var(--muted);margin-top:10px">
          <li>We’ll start with a 30–50 minute orientation to identify goals and matches.</li>
          <li>Each membership includes a set number of sessions per month; extra sessions can be added when available.</li>
          <li>Messaging is available for brief check-ins; full clinical content is reserved for sessions.</li>
        </ul>
      </div>
    </div>
  </main>

  <div style="max-width:var(--maxw);margin:22px auto;padding:0 20px">
    <div class="panel reveal" data-delay="400">
      <h3 style="margin-top:0">Practical notes</h3>
      <p class="note">Confidentiality is central. I follow professional ethical standards for record-keeping and privacy. There are legal limits to confidentiality (e.g., imminent risk, court orders). I do not provide crisis services; in emergencies, contact local emergency services or your crisis line.</p>
      <p class="note">Memberships are not insurance-based billing here; I provide receipts you may share with your insurer. We’ll discuss what fits your needs and boundaries of care during intake.</p>
    </div>

    <div style="display:flex;gap:12px;margin-top:12px;align-items:center">
      <button class="btn" id="tryNowBtn">Try a guided exercise</button>
      <a class="btn" href="book.html">Schedule a conversation</a>
    </div>
  </div>

  <footer>
    <div style="max-width:var(--maxw);margin:0 auto">Confidentiality, scope, and crisis note: Communications here are part of arranging care. Clinical work begins after informed consent. If you are in crisis or at risk of harm, contact local emergency services or your crisis line immediately. This website does not offer emergency care or guarantee specific outcomes.</div>
  </footer>

  <div class="modal-backdrop" id="modalBackdrop" aria-hidden="true">
    <div class="modal" role="dialog" aria-modal="true" aria-labelledby="modalTitle">
      <h2 id="modalTitle">Try a guided exercise</h2>
      <p style="margin:0 0 12px;color:var(--muted)">Choose a brief practice: breathing, journaling prompt, or a simple intention-setting pause.</p>

      <div class="controls">
        <button class="btn" data-mode="breath">Guided breathing</button>
        <button class="btn" data-mode="journal">Journaling prompt</button>
        <button class="btn" data-mode="intention">Set an intention</button>
        <button class="btn primary" id="startBtn">Start</button>
        <button class="btn" id="closeModal">Close</button>
      </div>

      <div class="exercise-area" id="exerciseArea">Select a practice and press Start.</div>
    </div>
  </div>

  <script>
    // Scroll reveal with prefers-reduced-motion support
    (function(){
      const prefersReduced = window.matchMedia('(prefers-reduced-motion: reduce)').matches;
      const revealEls = document.querySelectorAll('.reveal');
      if(prefersReduced){
        revealEls.forEach(el=>el.classList.add('visible'));
        return;
      }
      const io = new IntersectionObserver((entries)=>{
        entries.forEach(entry=>{
          if(entry.isIntersecting){
            const el = entry.target;
            const delay = parseInt(el.getAttribute('data-delay')||0,10);
            setTimeout(()=>el.classList.add('visible'), delay);
            io.unobserve(el);
          }
        });
      },{threshold:0.12});
      revealEls.forEach(el=>io.observe(el));
    })();

    // Guided exercise modal
    (function(){
      const backdrop = document.getElementById('modalBackdrop');
      const tryBtn = document.getElementById('tryNowBtn');
      const closeBtn = document.getElementById('closeModal');
      const startBtn = document.getElementById('startBtn');
      const exerciseArea = document.getElementById('exerciseArea');
      let selectedMode = 'breath';

      document.querySelectorAll('[data-mode]').forEach(btn=>{
        btn.addEventListener('click',()=>{
          selectedMode = btn.getAttribute('data-mode');
          document.querySelectorAll('[data-mode]').forEach(b=>b.style.outline='');
          btn.style.outline='2px solid rgba(106,166,201,0.28)';
        });
      });

      function open(){backdrop.style.display='flex';backdrop.setAttribute('aria-hidden','false');}
      function close(){backdrop.style.display='none';backdrop.setAttribute('aria-hidden','true');exerciseArea.textContent='Select a practice and press Start.'}

      tryBtn.addEventListener('click',open);
      closeBtn.addEventListener('click',close);

      startBtn.addEventListener('click',()=>{
        if(selectedMode==='breath') return startBreathing();
        if(selectedMode==='journal') return startJournaling();
        if(selectedMode==='intention') return startIntention();
      });

      // Simple accessible breathing exercise
      let breathTimer = null;
      function startBreathing(){
        const prefersReduced = window.matchMedia('(prefers-reduced-motion: reduce)').matches;
        exerciseArea.innerHTML = '';
        const circle = document.createElement('div');
        circle.setAttribute('aria-hidden','true');
        circle.style.width='130px';circle.style.height='130px';circle.style.borderRadius='50%';circle.style.background='radial-gradient(circle at 30% 30%, #d7f1fb, #a7dff0)';circle.style.display='flex';circle.style.alignItems='center';circle.style.justifyContent='center';circle.style.fontWeight='700';
        exerciseArea.appendChild(circle);
        let step=0;const phases=['Breathe in','Hold','Breathe out','Pause'];
        const timings = [4000,2000,4000,2000];
        if(prefersReduced){circle.textContent='Breathe slowly for a minute.';return}
        function tick(){
          circle.textContent = phases[step%phases.length];
          circle.style.transform = (step%2===0)?'scale(1.18)':'scale(0.92)';
          step++;
          breathTimer = setTimeout(tick,timings[(step-1)%timings.length]);
        }
        tick();
      }

      function startJournaling(){
        exerciseArea.innerHTML='';
        const prompt = document.createElement('div');
        prompt.style.maxWidth='100%';prompt.style.padding='12px';prompt.style.textAlign='left';prompt.style.color='var(--muted)';
        const suggestions = [
          'Write for five minutes about a small win from the last week.',
          'Describe one feeling you notice right now and where you feel it in your body.',
          'Name a worry and list one small step that might reduce it.'
        ];
        const choice = suggestions[Math.floor(Math.random()*suggestions.length)];
        prompt.textContent = 'Journaling prompt: "' + choice + '"';
        const area = document.createElement('textarea');
        area.style.width='100%';area.style.height='110px';area.style.marginTop='8px';area.style.padding='8px';area.style.borderRadius='8px';area.placeholder='Write freely...';
        exerciseArea.appendChild(prompt);exerciseArea.appendChild(area);
      }

      function startIntention(){
        exerciseArea.innerHTML='';
        const label = document.createElement('div');
        label.style.color='var(--muted)';label.style.marginBottom='8px';label.textContent='Set a short, realistic intention for the next 24 hours.';
        const input = document.createElement('input');
        input.type='text';input.style.width='100%';input.style.padding='10px';input.style.borderRadius='8px';input.placeholder='Example: Take a 10-minute walk after lunch.';
        const save = document.createElement('button');
        save.className='btn primary';save.textContent='Save intention';save.style.marginTop='8px';
        save.addEventListener('click',()=>{
          save.textContent='Saved';setTimeout(()=>save.textContent='Save intention',1200);
        });
        exerciseArea.appendChild(label);exerciseArea.appendChild(input);exerciseArea.appendChild(save);
      }

      // close modal on backdrop click
      backdrop.addEventListener('click',(e)=>{if(e.target===backdrop) close();});
    })();
  </script>
</body>
</html>"} 
{"path":"faq.html","content":"<!doctype html>
<html lang="en">
<head>
  <meta charset="utf-8">
  <meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width,initial-scale=1">
  <title>FAQs — Investment & Process</title>
  <meta name="description" content="Common questions about membership therapy, session logistics, confidentiality, and emergency guidance.">
  <style>
    :root{--maxw:980px;--ink:#07263e;--muted:#556571;--accent:#7dbdd6;--card:#fff}
    body{margin:0;font-family:system-ui,Segoe UI,Roboto,Arial;background:linear-gradient(180deg,#fff,#f7fbfd);color:var(--ink);-webkit-font-smoothing:antialiased}
    header{padding:18px 20px;max-width:var(--maxw);margin:0 auto;display:flex;justify-content:space-between;align-items:center}
    nav a{margin-left:16px;text-decoration:none;color:var(--ink)}
    main{max-width:var(--maxw);margin:18px auto;padding:0 20px}
    .faq-card{background:var(--card);border-radius:12px;padding:18px;box-shadow:0 10px 28px rgba(7,38,62,0.06);margin-bottom:12px}
    h1{font-size:22px;margin:0 0 6px}
    .q{font-weight:700}
    .a{color:var(--muted);margin-top:6px}
    .reveal{opacity:0;transform:translateY(12px);transition:opacity .5s ease,transform .5s ease}
    .reveal.visible{opacity:1;transform:none}
    @media (prefers-reduced-motion:reduce){.reveal{transition:none}}
  </style>
</head>
<body>
  <header>
    <div style="font-weight:700">{{BUSINESS_NAME}}</div>
    <nav>
      <a href="index.html">Home</a>
      <a href="about.html">About</a>
      <a href="fees.html">Investment</a>
      <a href="book.html">Book</a>
      <a href="contact.html">Contact</a>
    </nav>
  </header>

  <main>
    <h1>Frequently asked questions</h1>
    <p style="color:var(--muted);margin-bottom:12px">Concise answers to practical questions about membership, billing, confidentiality, and access.</p>

    <section class="faq-card reveal" data-delay="0">
      <div class="q">How do memberships begin?</div>
      <div class="a">We start with a brief intake session (30–50 minutes) to understand needs, clarify goals, and confirm a membership plan. That intake is followed by an agreement that outlines frequency, billing, and messaging expectations.</div>
    </section>

    <section class="faq-card reveal" data-delay="80">
      <div class="q">What if I need a shorter, time-limited plan?</div>
      <div class="a">Time-limited, goal-focused programs are available and framed as a single plan (e.g., 6–12 sessions). These are useful when there is a specific topic or transition to address. We’ll discuss suitability during the intake.</div>
    </section>

    <section class="faq-card reveal" data-delay="160">
      <div class="q">Do you take insurance?</div>
      <div class="a">I offer private-pay membership billing and provide receipts you can submit to your insurance for possible reimbursement. Coverage varies; check with your carrier. I can discuss documentation on request.</div>
    </section>

    <section class="faq-card reveal" data-delay="240">
      <div class="q">How is confidentiality handled?</div>
      <div class="a">Records are maintained according to professional standards. Confidentiality is respected except in legally defined situations (e.g., imminent risk of harm to self/others, suspected abuse, or court orders). We’ll review limits to confidentiality before beginning clinical work.</div>
    </section>

    <section class="faq-card reveal" data-delay="320">
      <div class="q">What if I’m in crisis?</div>
      <div class="a">This practice does not provide emergency/crisis services. If you are in immediate danger or experiencing an emergency, call local emergency services or your local crisis line. If you are in the U.S., you can also dial 988 for the Suicide & Crisis Lifeline.</div>
    </section>

    <section class="faq-card reveal" data-delay="400">
      <div class="q">How do cancellations and scheduling work?</div>
      <div class="a">Memberships include a scheduling agreement that outlines notice periods for cancellations and how to request additional sessions. If you need to reschedule, please contact the office within the agreed window so we can find a suitable time.</div>
    </section>

    <section class="faq-card reveal" data-delay="480">
      <div class="q">What is the therapeutic scope?</div>
      <div class="a">I work with adults on a range of personal, relational, and life-transition concerns. I do not provide forensic evaluations, court testimony, or emergency medical care. If your needs fall outside my scope, I’ll provide referrals to appropriate resources.</div>
    </section>

    <div style="margin-top:18px;display:flex;gap:10px;align-items:center">
      <a class="btn" href="book.html" style="padding:10px 14px;background:var(--accent);color:#fff;border-radius:8px;text-decoration:none">Start with an intake</a>
      <button class="btn" id="tryNowFaq">Try a guided exercise</button>
    </div>

    <p style="margin-top:18px;color:var(--muted);font-size:13px">If your question is not listed, please reach out by email at {{EMAIL}} or phone at {{PHONE}}.</p>
  </main>

  <div class="modal-backdrop" id="modalBackdropFaq" style="display:none;align-items:center;justify-content:center;position:fixed;inset:0;background:rgba(6,20,34,0.45);z-index:60">
    <div style="background:#fff;padding:18px;border-radius:12px;max-width:600px;width:100%">
      <h2 style="margin:0 0 8px">Brief grounding</h2>
      <p style="color:var(--muted)">Sit comfortably. Close your eyes if you like. Notice your breath for three cycles: inhale for 3, exhale for 4. Repeat twice more. Open your eyes slowly.</p>
      <div style="margin-top:10px;text-align:right"><button class="btn" id="closeFaq">Close</button></div>
    </div>
  </div>

  <script>
    // reveal logic (same pattern as other pages)
    (function(){
      const prefersReduced = window.matchMedia('(prefers-reduced-motion: reduce)').matches;
      const items = document.querySelectorAll('.reveal');
      if(prefersReduced){items.forEach(i=>i.classList.add('visible'));return}
      const io = new IntersectionObserver((entries)=>{entries.forEach(e=>{if(e.isIntersecting){const el=e.target;setTimeout(()=>el.classList.add('visible'),parseInt(el.getAttribute('data-delay')||0,10));io.unobserve(el);}});},{threshold:0.12});
      items.forEach(i=>io.observe(i));
    })();

    // small modal for FAQ grounding
    (function(){
      const btn = document.getElementById('tryNowFaq');
      const modal = document.getElementById('modalBackdropFaq');
      const close = document.getElementById('closeFaq');
      btn.addEventListener('click',()=>{modal.style.display='flex'});
      close.addEventListener('click',()=>{modal.style.display='none'});
      modal.addEventListener('click',(e)=>{if(e.target===modal) modal.style.display='none'});
    })();
  </script>
</body>
</html>"} 
{"path":"book.html","content":"<!doctype html>
<html lang="en">
<head>
  <meta charset="utf-8">
  <meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width,initial-scale=1">
  <title>Schedule an Intake — {{BUSINESS_NAME}}</title>
  <meta name="description" content="Arrange a confidential intake conversation, learn about membership options, or request a short consultation.">
  <style>
    :root{--maxw:980px;--ink:#05243d;--muted:#5d6f7d;--accent:#6fb0cf}
    body{margin:0;font-family:system-ui,Segoe UI,Arial;background:#f6fbfd;color:var(--ink)}
    header{padding:18px 20px;max-width:var(--maxw);margin:0 auto;display:flex;justify-content:space-between;align-items:center}
    nav a{margin-left:14px;text-decoration:none;color:var(--ink)}
    main{max-width:var(--maxw);margin:20px auto;padding:0 20px}
    .card{background:#fff;border-radius:12px;padding:18px;box-shadow:0 12px 32px rgba(7,36,62,0.06)}
    label{display:block;margin-top:10px;font-size:14px}
    input,select,textarea{width:100%;padding:10px;margin-top:6px;border-radius:8px;border:1px solid rgba(7,36,62,0.06)}
    .row{display:grid;grid-template-columns:1fr 1fr;gap:12px}
    .hint{font-size:13px;color:var(--muted)}
    .btn{display:inline-block;padding:10px 14px;border-radius:8px;background:var(--accent);color:white;text-decoration:none;border:0}
    .secondary{background:#fff;border:1px solid rgba(7,36,62,0.06);color:var(--ink)}
    .reveal{opacity:0;transform:translateY(12px);transition:opacity .5s ease,transform .5s ease}
    .reveal.visible{opacity:1;transform:none}
    @media (max-width:720px){.row{grid-template-columns:1fr}}
    @media (prefers-reduced-motion:reduce){.reveal{transition:none}}
  </style>
</head>
<body>
  <header>
    <div style="font-weight:700">{{BUSINESS_NAME}}</div>
    <nav>
      <a href="index.html">Home</a>
      <a href="specialties.html">Focus</a>
      <a href="fees.html">Investment</a>
      <a href="faq.html">FAQs</a>
      <a href="contact.html">Contact</a>
    </nav>
  </header>

  <main>
    <div class="card reveal" data-delay="0">
      <h1 style="margin:0 0 6px">Request an intake or consultation</h1>
      <p class="hint">Use this form to request a private conversation about membership fit. I typically respond within 48 business hours.</p>

      <form id="bookingForm" style="margin-top:12px" aria-label="Booking form">
        <div class="row">
          <div>
            <label for="name">Full name</label>
            <input id="name" name="name" required>
          </div>
          <div>
            <label for="phone">Phone</label>
            <input id="phone" name="phone">
          </div>
        </div>

        <label for="email">Email</label>
        <input id="email" name="email" type="email" required>

